@startsalt
' Screen: Edge Editor (form for creating / editing a graph edge)
' User Stories:
'   - As a tester, I can define an edge connecting two nodes
'   - As a tester, I can select a match method and configure its pattern
'   - As a tester, I can optionally label the edge and set its priority

{
  == Edit Edge ==
  ..
  {
    <b>Source Node</b>
    "greeting                                  "
    <i>Pre-filled from selection. Not editable here.</i>
  }
  ..
  {
    <b>Target Node</b> <color:red>*</color>
    ^Select target node... ▼^
    ..
    <i>Available: ask_quantity · confirm_order · checkout_terminal · error_handler</i>
  }
  ..
  {
    <b>Match Method</b> <color:red>*</color>
    ^intent ▼^
    ..
    <i>Options: intent · regex · semantic · always · never · custom</i>
  }
  ..
  {
    <b>Pattern / Config</b>
    "add_to_cart                               "
    <i>For intent: the intent label. For regex: the pattern. For semantic: embedding threshold.</i>
  }
  ..
  {
    <b>Label</b> <i>(optional)</i>   |   <b>Priority</b> <i>(lower = higher priority)</i>
    "add to cart intent "   |   "10                    "
  }
  ==
  {
    [ Cancel ]  |  [ Save Edge ]
  }
}

@endsalt
